{"quest":"Sheep Shearer","character":"Fred the Farmer","text":"My sheep are getting mighty woolly. I'd be much obliged if you could shear them. And while you're at it, spin the wool for me too.","uri":"f3b09e19c7fca72537e0e065c0feea9a.mp3"}
