{"quest":"Sheep Shearer","character":"Fred the Farmer","text":"Some say it's a black hearted shapeshifter, hungering for the souls of hard working decent folk like me. Others say it's just a sheep.","uri":"a915e3be4820fece07ee6f631c8d8132.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sheep Shearer","character":"Fred the Farmer","text":"Suit yourself.","uri":"081b3ae1039ad3f99f7813438008e918.mp3"}
