{"quest":"Sheep Shearer","character":"Fred the Farmer","text":"The nearest Spinning Wheel can be found on the first floor of Lumbridge Castle.","uri":"6e63a2c996b1aaa84d7b711dfa97ce7a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sheep Shearer","character":"Fred the Farmer","text":"To get to Lumbridge Castle just follow the road east.","uri":"20988f5003d219ef213d77eafa13d16b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sheep Shearer","character":"Fred the Farmer","text":"Well go find a spinning wheel then. You can find one on the first floor of Lumbridge Castle, just walk east on the road outside my house and you'll find Lumbridge.","uri":"6a272b44776ea978b14eb8eb00d118fa.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sheep Shearer","character":"Fred the Farmer","text":"Well I don't have all day to stand around and gossip. Are you going to shear my sheep or what!","uri":"0a385d7b17c6302a400e01c7866252a2.mp3"}
{"quest":"Sheep Shearer","character":"Fred the Farmer","text":"Well now, no one has ever seen The Thing. That's why we call it The Thing, 'cos we don't know what it is.","uri":"19fe56466a4c76a98117a7cd9c2a6121.mp3"}
